Description: Say that a film has no sound when it has a picture and no audio track: a message in the window for a few seconds and the volume button's tooltip, with the sentence and the rule of the stereo layer. The volume control stays usable.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, Sparky Stereo OS (ORDER 579)
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-11-15
Assisted-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 via Claude Code

